-- SQL HOLE INSIDE A COMMENT ------------------------------------ main.kl  K1605

This hole is inside an SQL comment, so the database would never see its value. It is almost always a leftover from editing the query.

3│     let q = sql"SELECT id FROM users /* {name} */"
                                            ^^^^

Help: Move the hole out of the comment, or delete it.

Learn more: kalam explain K1605
